[0.0-1.5] elder: Hello?
[2.1-5.2] caller: Grandma? It's me, your grandson. I'm in big trouble.
[5.8-7.6] elder: Oh my goodness, what happened?
[8.2-13.4] caller: I hit a car and the police took me in. I need bail money tonight.
[14.0-15.8] elder: How much do you need?
[16.4-19.9] caller: Two thousand. And please don't tell Mom, she'll kill me.
[20.5-22.3] elder: Should I call your father?
[22.9-27.1] caller: No, there's no time. My lawyer will call you about the payment.
